@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory

### Place a hold (copy its id into holdId below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "keyboard", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "mouse", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Active holds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holds?status=Active&limit=50

### Fetch one hold
@holdId = replace-with-created-id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/holds/{{holdId}}

### Release
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/holds/{{holdId}}

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
